<title>USA: Int'l Telecommunications director resigns.</title>
<headline>Int'l Telecommunications director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Telecommunications Data Systems Inc on Monday said Michael Kalogris resigned from the company's board of directors to form his own company.</p>
<p>Kalogris had served on the five-member board since August, the company said. A successor will be named shortly.</p>
